  },
  data: {
    LLM: "1. Play begins with the highest double in the center.\n2. Each player builds THEIR OWN line radiating outwards from that center double.\n3. The first tile played by each player must match the center double.\n4. **Buying Tiles**: If you cannot play on your line, you must ask the player to your LEFT. If that player has a matching tile, they MUST sell it to you for 1 chip. If they don't, you ask the next player until someone sells or no one has it.",
    Player: "1. Play begins with the highest double in the center.\n2. Each player builds THEIR OWN line radiating outwards from that center double.\n3. The first tile played by each player must match the center double.\n4. **Buying Tiles**: If you cannot play on your line, you must ask the player to your LEFT. If that player has a matching tile, they MUST sell it to you for 1 chip. If they don't, you ask the next player until someone sells or no one has it.",
    objective: 'Be the first player to play all tiles in your hand OR have the fewest pips remaining.',
    gameplay: "1. Play begins with the highest double in the center.\n2. Each player builds THEIR OWN line radiating outwards from that center double.\n3. The first tile played by each player must match the center double.\n4. **Buying Tiles**: If you cannot play on your line, you must ask the player to your LEFT. If that player has a matching tile, they MUST sell it to you for 1 chip. If they don't, you ask the next player until someone sells or no one has it.",
    keyRules: [
      'Highest double starts in center; play proceeds clockwise.',
      'Each player builds their own line from the center; first tile of each line must match the starting double.',
      'If you cannot play, ask the player to your left for a matching tile; they must sell for 1 chip if they have one, else ask next clockwise.',
      'If no one has a matching tile, turn your line face down and pass; you can still sell to others on their turns.',
      'Round ends when a player empties their hand; winner receives 1 chip from each other player; most chips wins.',
    ],
